rows=[
f(122,'Sprint lifecycle declarations conflict and require their own future outputs','Retrospective pre-gate requires retrospective and VP briefing artifacts before retrospective; VP briefing requires its own briefing before evaluation. Planning supplies three documents but review demands eight including future completion/retro. Evidence roots disagree across manager/review/execution, commitment is soft in538 but hard in541, and deprecated improve-autoskill still has a required hash. No single literal first-run state machine can satisfy all these requirements without undefined placeholders/precedence.',[e(552,13,33),e(556,81,90),e(545,41,45),e(549,293,311),e(542,48,53),e(543,125,148),e(541,369,377),e(538,52,56),e(541,176,210),e(554,401,473)],'Choose one versioned artifact/state contract, distinct creation/completion states and canonical roots; migrate historical recipes explicitly and test first-run, exception and cleanup transitions.','CHECK-101 finite prerequisite cycle plus complete cross-file review. Actual hosts may implement different precedence; no orchestrator run.'),
f(123,'Sprint parsing loses or rejects supported cleanup identities','Both planning and review derive sprint_number using branch.split("-")[1], so sprint-108-0 becomes108 and targets the parent sprint. Explicit108-0 instead reaches int(sprint_number), which raises ValueError. The advertised cleanup hierarchy is therefore not represented by these examples.',[e(545,11,24),e(545,144,156),e(549,13,26),e(549,77,90),e(538,148,168)],'Treat sprint identity as an opaque validated string; preserve the entire suffix, and use a separately declared numeric database key when required.','CHECK-099 reproduces both exact expressions without invoking workflow.'),
f(124,'Displayed hard gates can accept empty evidence or return successful shell status after refusal','Planning artifact gate uses test-f only and merely echoes HARD BLOCK on failure, without exit1; its branch ends in successful echo. Review also uses existence rather than content despite a later all-documents-have-content condition. Completion predicate accepts any text containing two section names, including a zero-story zero-result document. Other manual instructions are stronger, so the snippets do not implement the claimed composite gate.',[e(549,373,389),e(545,50,88),e(545,112,125),e(541,568,605)],'Implement explicit nonzero refusal, typed required nonempty artifacts, source/task/result binding and unknown/error branches. Keep presence, structural and executed-verification states distinct.','CHECK-100 demonstrates exact header predicate; shell exit behavior follows the displayed echo-only branch, no shell execution claimed.'),
f(125,'Web-edit audit compares sprint branch to itself and cannot establish UI origin','The recipe selects sprint-{N}..HEAD. On that sprint branch at its own tip this is empty, omitting every sprint commit. Noreply author and at-most-two files identify neither GitHub UI origin nor bypassed CI; comment mentions no GPG signature but code never checks one. Recursive VETO grep similarly counts mentions rather than distinct events.',[e(554,43,70),e(554,272,306)],'Bind a recorded sprint base and reviewed head; inspect provider event/CI metadata if UI origin matters, otherwise label only the heuristic. Count structured event IDs rather than text mentions.','CHECK-102 exact revision-reachability model; no network or Git mutation/replay.'),
f(126,'Garden/count pairs do not diagnose or detect all colour drift','The census skill says pairing operation count with substitution count identifies size change versus colour drift. Distinct colour assignments can have equal operation/substitution counts: A:X→X,B:Y→Y admits AA and BB; A:X→X,B:X→Y admits AA and BA. Both counts are(2,2) while the wiring relation changes. Even when counts move they do not uniquely identify cause.',[e(560,79,100)],'Bind full operation identities/colours and the composable relation or its canonical source digest; use counts as diagnostics and preserve valid exact fixture/population assertions.','CHECK-103 enumerates all four unary pairs in each2-operation garden.'),
f(127,'Uncalled-module limitations incorrectly claim dynamic imports only under-report','The skill correctly admits stem/dynamic-import limitations, then says both failure modes are toward silence. A static test import plus a production importlib.import_module call produces test-only static importers although production is wired: an over-report. Static graph absence cannot establish runtime unreachability.',[e(563,18,25),e(563,73,89)],'Describe both false-positive and false-negative modes; require caller/entrypoint/plugin review before declaring a module unwired, and distinguish static references from actual reachable execution.','CHECK-104 parses complete independent code strings only; external operations owner not rerun.'),
f(128,'Missing declared falsifier does not imply unfalsifiable acceptance criterion','The gate auditor says every implementation satisfies a criterion naming no falsifier. Build success or a test predicate can fail without a separately written Decisive mutation field; a syntax mutation is an immediate counterexample. The later diagnostic-only count disclaimer is correct but does not justify the earlier equivalence.',[e(564,19,25),e(564,64,93)],'Report missing explicit falsification documentation separately from actual falsifiability and semantic adequacy; inspect/test the real predicate before saying nothing can turn it red.','CHECK-105 parses valid/invalid Python source to show a concrete falsifier without a named declaration.'),
f(129,'Publication language sweeps cannot certify total mathematical honesty','Anti-DIME bans proves and mathematical/common terms such as Primal Dual and Quarantine, while its own verdict guarantees100percent verified/honest materials. Generic wording controls can reject valid mathematical statements and still miss false claims. Public-claim statuses also overlap: a fully proved Lean implication under explicit analytic hypotheses is both MECHANIZED and HYP_GATED unless precedence is declared.',[e(568,34,61),e(575,21,31),e(577,19,36)],'Separate mathematical result status, premise scope, editorial style and publication authorization; declare status precedence or independent axes. Emit scoped reviewed findings rather than100percent truth certification and narrow lexical bans by context.','Full-body logical review; no external source, publication or Lean replay.')]
